    Atera's install link carries a per-customer <code>cid</code>, so put <code>{cid}</code> where it goes &mdash; each customer's
    URL is then built from their synced Atera customer id, with nothing to set up per customer. A single fixed URL would
    enrol every machine in the estate into one Atera account. Order of precedence: per-customer override (Advanced, below)
